t's interest and by  financial powers  100 miles or so west of venice is  bergamo  one of the worst hit cities in the  pandemic  prosecutors are investigating the  government's covid planning on behalf  of the families of those who died here  they've asked for the who  to help their investigation but so far  it has refused even saying staff members  have immunity from questioning it's left  the prosecution teams confused and  suspicious  and talking to dr zambon  disappeared  politico  responding to our questions the who said  that the report  was published too early and it had  inconsistencies  and inaccuracies they did however say  that they are reviewing what assistance  they can give  to the prosecutors here in bergamo  [Music]  dr zambon is now unemployed and has been  forced to put his home and his beloved  piano up for sale  the prosecutors in bergamo say his  testimony and any evidence he possesses  continues to be part of their  investigation  preliminary findings of that  investigation are expected next month  stuart ramsey sky news northern italy
 

